Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:46:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] Add two-seed rollout with ordinary completion reuse

Compare ordinary completions of the two highest-ranked legal joins
at each decision. Reuse the first ordinary completion as a protected
candidate instead of running a separate baseline search.

Share exact input-object probe metrics within a flat inner-join
strategy and keep other shapes uncached. Retain completed ordinary
and rollout paths, including partial paths, for final selection.
